<title>NETHERLANDS: Finnish minister confident of EU pact deal.</title>
<headline>Finnish minister confident of EU pact deal.</headline>
<dateline>ASMSTERDAM 1997-06-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Finnish Finance Minister Sauli Niinifto said he was confident that a European Union summit would reach agreement on conditions for European monetary union including the disputed budget stability pact on Monday.</p>
<p>&quot;Big steps were taken yesterday. It's quite obvious there will be a good agreement about that (today),&quot; he told Reuters.</p>
</text>
